"Warning: installing the GXDE-modified version may change DTK behavior in "
"other desktop sessions. GXDE does not guarantee that DTK applications will "
"behave as expected outside the GXDE session."
msgstr ""
"Warning: installing the GXDE-modified version may change DTK behavior in "
"other desktop sessions. GXDE does not guarantee that DTK applications will "
"behave as expected outside the GXDE session."

